  id: 5
  displayName: Conspiracy
  type: Conspiracy
  text: Big Pharma doesn't want you to know this. They can't patent a natural cure,
    so they try to suppress the truth.
  debunkingText: "\uFFFDThis is a conspiracy tactic to create an \"Us vs. Them\"
    narrative. Claims of \"suppressed cures\" almost never have verifiable evidence
    to support them."
  hintText: Claims a secret group is hiding the truth or controlling what people
    believe, usually without strong proof.
